    "note": "Swan 48-233 230V AC system. Sources: shore inlet (+SHO_GEN_BOX) and optional generator feed the Victron Quattro 24/5000 inverter/charger (-U01) AC inputs. The Quattro AC OUTPUT (via galvanic isolator -GI) is the system AC busbar, distributed through the +AC_OUT output box (terminals -X1) as three feeds AC_OUT1/2/3 to the +JB_AC distribution board where branch breakers live. AC_OUT1 -> outlets (F33 galley, F34 accommodation, sheet 120). AC_OUT2 -> water heater (F35) + generator start charger (F01, sheet 110). AC_OUT3 -> air conditioning (F36, sheet 113 -> sheet 111 chiller breakers F01-F05). Electric stove/hob (-FOUT5/-HOB) was moved to sheet 100 and is fed off the Quattro AC-OUT bus directly. The Quattro charger DC side links to dc_distribution.json (not referenced here per AC/DC separation). Breaker amp ratings read directly from sheets; series order shore/gen -> Quattro confirmed on sheet 100. Washer (sheet 124) and lazarette outlets (sheet 125) are daisy-chained outlets off the accommodation outlet strings."
  },
